+# Jellyfin Onboarding & Controlled Media Contract (PW-D06)
+
+## Readiness and Boundaries
+- **Status**: Jellyfin deployment readiness and OIDC integration verified via service epic requirements.
+- **Scope**: Lower-layer OIDC authentication and controlled media streaming are verified via browser journeys.
+
+## Journeys & Selectors
+1. **Unauthenticated Smoke**: Access login page (`/web/index.html`), verify page title and render without credentials.
+2. **Authentication & Roles**:
+   - Standard User: Login via OIDC, verify permitted library access.
+   - Restricted/Denied User: Login via restricted account, verify denial or restricted library visibility.
+   - Admin User: Login via admin account, verify non-destructive admin navigation.
+   - Logout: Trigger session termination and verify return to login screen.
+3. **Controlled Media Playback**: Open controlled non-personal media item, initiate playback, observe deterministic play state and optional transcode signal, then stop playback cleanly.
